{"date":"2025-12-14","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_7af5ed012848d5a3e2f0f4e9018c15fd","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1765704600,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-12-11","chunk":0,"id":"m_234763f4d2c7ac0259b3a7a07f3c9874"}}},{"id":"m_e99cf82da023db084f546c233af6755f","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1765704637,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b6584176a83122eececd67535b029dd5","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1765704674,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_cce86f825f4abe1f280297ad582a6640","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1765704711,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_d6d6a7e924fac1dadbe35bec305e8055","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1765704748,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_89ca408b4f5fb170e8e825eaf2bdad2b","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1765704785,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_6f892551a2753cd8e74de7ef76fd693c","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1765704822,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_f12c0a75769a232bd0f416404382b80d","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1765704859,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_a4b47f7b9b299222a445b9aac61d5465","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1765704896,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_bc7f45fac8825af6eb8afc67c7d04c8f","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1765704933,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_0af86151dee6bdcf5767c1a516ae4967","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1765704970,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_7cda0c711455bf9116798b1a53eba5ae","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1765705007,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_2b37152d4dc92a59d3e089f1bf5f08cd","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1765705044,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_956cf85f09eaaca9a1c8ea0d5de24dcd","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1765705081,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_f1404a53e3c8161505d0563a96221c41","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1765705118,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_94e4b4c24fbbc7077c64e8e4515f9b36","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1765705155,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_3fb47cf92c925260886324d76893773e","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1765705192,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_3a408bfad907636ee290af56419151d4","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1765705229,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e92bb09458bc5dea8caf7c43bcfdebd4","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1765705266,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_69f8f72e3ab802d5a25c2ecaea6622ce","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1765705303,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_d7bfbf31eb58490fcf8f35db4009c3de","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1765705340,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4e01410a6fa9dbb32c8511fdd52a1603","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1765705377,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c381405a97699449c10e084fa470ea54","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1765705414,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_60b5150c275c12b59cfecca3e9b08df2","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1765705451,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
